# Tools sunset (Sprint M, 2026-05-08): invoice-decoder + menu-design
# retired. No replacement was built; redirect to the tools catalog
# so visitors land on a clean index of what is shipping. Sub-paths
# included so stale service-worker / manifest / chunked-JS bookmarks
# don't 404 noisily.
#
# Why 301 instead of 410: Cloudflare Workers Builds rejects 410 in
# _redirects (validation error 10021 — only 200/301/302/303/307/308
# accepted). Pages would accept 410, but this site deploys via
# `wrangler versions upload`. 301 to /tools/ is the closest honest
# alternative — the catalog is where someone looking for a retired
# tool should land. The 404.html sunset-path scrub still handles
# orphan-PWA cleanup for any path that slips through.
#
# menu-polish is gone with no replacement; 301 to the surviving Menu
# Drop-In offer.
/tools/invoice-decoder/                          /tools/                        301
/tools/invoice-decoder/*                         /tools/                        301
/tools/menu-design/                              /tools/                        301
/tools/menu-design/*                             /tools/                        301
/es/tools/invoice-decoder/                       /es/tools/                     301
/es/tools/invoice-decoder/*                      /es/tools/                     301
/es/tools/menu-design/                           /es/tools/                     301
/es/tools/menu-design/*                          /es/tools/                     301
